# Generated compliance artifacts (built by CI, see scripts/gen_third_party_licenses.py).
# THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md is deliberately NOT here: it is generated but
# committed, so attribution is readable in the repository rather than only
# inside the image and the release assets. CI fails if the committed copy
# drifts from what the locked environment produces.
sbom.cdx.json
